cross_domain_transfer.pattern:
Query before dispatch: SHOpenFolderAndSelectItems returns S_OK whether or not anything gets selected, so ask Explorer's own filter first and dispatch only when it will list the item. The known failure mode is the query drifting from the dispatch. It is contained three ways:
- the query is the shell's own state;
- every unmeasured cell but one errs toward refusal;
- the test override can only narrow the query, never widen it.
